the User is a set.
this's Name is a text.
this's Age is a number.

the People is an actor.
this's Active is a User.

this can Greet.
this's Greet does...
    when this has Active?
        when this's Active's Age is 30?
            log "thirty".
        or when this's Active's Age is not 30?
            log "other".
        or?
            log "unknown".
    or?
        log "no active user".
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

People's Active is a User with Name "Chris", Age 30.

do People's Greet...
    when ok?
        log "done".
    or?
        log that's error.
